# {{id}}

This repo ships the {{displayName}} plugin for Claude Code and Codex. It follows the Sidecut house style, which `bun run style` checks.

## Commands

| Command | Does |
| --- | --- |
| `bun run build` | Bundles the MCP server into `plugins/{{id}}/server/index.mjs`, writes its bundled licences and the Codex profile of each subagent |
| `bun run check` | Runs everything CI runs: Biome, types, the house-style checker, tests and the stale-bundle check |
| `bun run fix` | Formats and fixes what Biome can |
| `bun run style` | Checks the repo against the Sidecut house style |
| `bun run test` | Runs the tests |

## Layout

```text
plugins/{{id}}/   the plugin; the only folder that gets installed
scripts/               build-server.ts, the same in every Sidecut plugin repo
tests/                 tests for the plugin and its MCP server
.github/workflows/     CI, using sidecut-ops' runner picker
```

## Rules

- Run `bun run build` after changing anything in `plugins/{{id}}/server/src/` or `plugins/{{id}}/agents/`, and commit what it writes.
- Any change under `plugins/{{id}}/` bumps the version in both manifests and `package.json` and adds a CHANGELOG entry.

